1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240
Variable refresh rate

2
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:02,260
does not make

3
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,580
the GPU faster.

4
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,260
It changes when

5
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:05,700
a compatible

6
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,600
monitor begins its next

7
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:08,140
refresh.

8
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:08,860
A fixed

9
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:09,920
display keeps ticking

10
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:10,720
at one rate,

11
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:11,560
even while

12
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:12,740
game frames finish

13
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:13,240
early,

14
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,640
late or somewhere

15
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,220
between.

16
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,180
With VRR,

17
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:18,700
the monitor

18
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,780
can refresh when

19
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:20,060
the next

20
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,020
frame is ready,

21
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,080
reducing repeated frames,

22
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:24,460
stutter and tearing

23
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,880
inside its range.

24
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,225
That range

25
00:00:27,225 --> 00:00:27,951
has limits.

26
00:00:27,951 --> 00:00:28,999
A display might

27
00:00:28,999 --> 00:00:30,611
vary between sixty-four

28
00:00:30,611 --> 00:00:31,659
and one hundred

29
00:00:31,659 --> 00:00:32,787
and twenty hertz,

30
00:00:32,787 --> 00:00:33,352
not from

31
00:00:33,352 --> 00:00:34,600
zero to infinity.

32
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,105
Fall below

33
00:00:36,105 --> 00:00:37,123
the lower bound

34
00:00:37,123 --> 00:00:37,828
and frames

35
00:00:37,828 --> 00:00:38,847
may be repeated.

36
00:00:38,847 --> 00:00:39,552
Exceed the

37
00:00:39,552 --> 00:00:40,648
top and familiar

38
00:00:40,648 --> 00:00:43,040
fixed-refresh constraints return.

39
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,140
VRR is therefore

40
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:46,200
timing flexibility,

41
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:47,860
not free performance.

42
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:49,160
The GPU,

43
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,040
display,

44
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,460
connection and presentation

45
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:53,240
path must all support

46
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:53,700
it.
